WEBVTT

00:17.350 --> 00:19.352
[somber music playing]

00:54.387 --> 00:57.015
[Se-bin sobbing]

01:06.983 --> 01:09.611
[sobbing continues]

01:13.740 --> 01:14.824
Oh, shit.

01:17.494 --> 01:18.536
[sighs]

01:57.283 --> 02:00.161
Your house isn't over there, is it?

02:02.122 --> 02:02.997
No.

02:03.915 --> 02:05.792
I think they're burning Hyosan down.

02:06.543 --> 02:07.544
Seoul University.

02:08.044 --> 02:08.878
What about it?

02:09.546 --> 02:11.172
To save the majority,

02:13.091 --> 02:15.510
just how heartless do you think
you need to be?

02:19.472 --> 02:21.558
Did they teach you things
like that at school?

02:27.021 --> 02:29.357
[Ho-cheol] We don't learn
that kind of stuff in my major.

02:30.358 --> 02:31.901
I'm not sure which major has that.

02:39.075 --> 02:40.243
Oh…

02:43.621 --> 02:46.374
[groaning]

02:58.052 --> 03:00.054
[theme music]

03:02.140 --> 03:05.143
[squelching]

03:14.986 --> 03:17.989
[all snarling]

03:27.665 --> 03:28.791
[Dae-su groans]

03:29.500 --> 03:30.835
Stay still.

03:57.654 --> 03:58.529
Let's go.

04:05.411 --> 04:06.579
On-jo, let's go.

04:14.212 --> 04:15.964
I can't go on like this.

04:18.299 --> 04:20.885
I'm sorry. Can you wait for just a sec?

04:22.470 --> 04:24.222
Actually, never mind.

04:24.305 --> 04:26.724
Go ahead. I'll catch up with you.

04:39.070 --> 04:40.446
I'll go with her.

04:40.530 --> 04:41.948
I'll go, too.

04:42.031 --> 04:44.325
I'm also going.
[groans]

04:44.409 --> 04:45.702
[Su-hyeok] No, you hurt your leg.

04:45.785 --> 04:48.246
Wu-jin, keep an eye on Dae-su.

05:38.254 --> 05:39.464
Hey, Cheong-san.

05:46.429 --> 05:47.638
Cheong-san!

05:57.565 --> 05:59.776
Cheong-san, you're such a jerk!

05:59.859 --> 06:02.361
[sobbing]

06:16.000 --> 06:17.251
Let's go.

06:19.629 --> 06:21.923
I don't smell anything.
There's no one here.

06:25.885 --> 06:28.012
Let's say bye to Cheong-san…

06:31.724 --> 06:32.767
and go.

06:41.234 --> 06:44.570
[both sobbing]

07:02.797 --> 07:04.966
Careful. Slowly.

07:05.049 --> 07:06.134
Oh, shit.

07:06.217 --> 07:08.678
[grunting]

07:08.761 --> 07:10.763
[suspenseful music playing]

07:15.810 --> 07:18.020
CHEONG-SAN CHICKEN
CHICKEN AND BEER

07:18.104 --> 07:21.524
THIS IS A SAFE ZONE

07:26.988 --> 07:29.282
-[snarling]
-[gunshots]

07:30.491 --> 07:32.285
[soldier] One infected, eliminated.

07:33.077 --> 07:34.120
Pulling out.

07:38.833 --> 07:40.168
THIS IS A RESTRICTED AREA

07:42.503 --> 07:44.547
THIS IS A SAFE ZONE

07:48.843 --> 07:51.345
[Nam-ra] The soldiers saw
that we were at the school.

07:52.138 --> 07:54.807
They left us there without helping us,
and then they bombed it.

07:57.101 --> 07:59.395
Maybe they actually want us to die.

08:01.272 --> 08:02.523
I don't believe that.

08:05.693 --> 08:07.737
I think it's all because of me.

08:10.781 --> 08:13.075
Because we were with zombies,

08:14.785 --> 08:18.414
they must think we're neither
a zombie nor human, like me.

08:20.541 --> 08:22.543
Maybe that's what they thought.

08:23.252 --> 08:24.795
Don't talk like that.

08:26.714 --> 08:29.675
Is it really okay for me
to stay with you guys like this?

08:29.759 --> 08:32.470
You're still our friend
and our class president.

08:33.554 --> 08:35.598
We couldn't have made it
this far without you.

08:36.557 --> 08:37.892
Still…

08:37.975 --> 08:40.019
[On-jo] You haven't turned yet,

08:41.354 --> 08:42.605
and you never will.

08:51.614 --> 08:54.075
I really wanna do that again
in the future.

08:56.619 --> 09:00.164
That was my first time
sitting around a fire with friends.

09:02.291 --> 09:04.544
We'll be able to do that again, right?

09:05.753 --> 09:07.171
Let's do it again tonight.

09:09.882 --> 09:11.717
[Mi-jin sighs]
What the hell?

09:11.801 --> 09:12.969
[Hyo-ryeong] What's wrong?

09:13.052 --> 09:15.805
Shit. I think we're lost.

09:15.888 --> 09:18.975
-There's no trail?
-There hasn't been a trail for a while.

09:19.058 --> 09:21.394
I think we've been going
in fucking circle.

09:21.477 --> 09:23.563
Why did you come this way
if there was no trail?

09:23.646 --> 09:25.439
If we go down the wrong way,
it will be Hyosan.

09:26.524 --> 09:27.441
[groans]

09:28.484 --> 09:29.986
Ha-ri.

09:30.069 --> 09:30.987
Look.

09:34.740 --> 09:35.992
There's something there.

09:42.123 --> 09:43.541
[groans]

09:51.924 --> 09:53.342
Someone must have left it here.

09:54.218 --> 09:56.053
Who did something so nice, huh?

09:56.137 --> 09:58.014
[gasps]
A ginseng digger?

09:59.390 --> 10:00.808
Who is that?

10:06.188 --> 10:07.440
There's another one.

10:42.808 --> 10:44.810
RESCUE TEAM 1 NAM SO-JU

11:04.455 --> 11:06.332
[sobbing]

11:34.151 --> 11:37.321
[growling]

11:43.327 --> 11:45.746
[raindrops pattering]

11:47.665 --> 11:48.749
Status?

11:49.500 --> 11:51.502
Like people are about to die
of starvation.

11:52.086 --> 11:53.838
Just preserve and transport them.

11:54.588 --> 11:56.632
Under no circumstances
can you do to harm them.

11:57.216 --> 11:58.092
Of course, sir.

12:09.562 --> 12:13.774
[Dae-su groaning]

12:17.445 --> 12:19.947
Didn't he say to go to Yangdong?

12:20.781 --> 12:22.867
You don't think there are zombies here,
too, do you?

12:23.409 --> 12:24.618
No way.

12:25.369 --> 12:28.706
Maybe they evacuated,
because it's next to Hyosan.

12:29.331 --> 12:31.917
Hey, I'm getting a bad feeling about this.

12:32.501 --> 12:34.336
Where is everyone?

12:37.548 --> 12:38.507
We're okay here.

12:38.591 --> 12:39.967
Why? How do you know that?

12:40.759 --> 12:44.013
There are no broken windows,
or blood on the streets.

12:46.474 --> 12:49.101
It wouldn't be this clean
if there had been a zombie rampage.

12:52.938 --> 12:53.898
What?

12:54.523 --> 12:55.858
Hold on.

12:57.401 --> 12:58.986
[Nam-ra sniffing]

13:10.539 --> 13:12.541
[eerie music playing]

13:12.625 --> 13:14.335
[zombies growling]

13:15.002 --> 13:16.128
Nam-ra, what is it?

13:19.423 --> 13:22.009
-[groaning]
-What's up? You hear something?

13:22.760 --> 13:23.677
Zombies.

13:24.428 --> 13:26.305
[zombies growling]

13:26.388 --> 13:27.389
[gasps]

13:27.473 --> 13:28.349
Where, though?

13:30.768 --> 13:31.727
Everywhere.

13:32.311 --> 13:33.729
A lot… A lot of them?

13:34.313 --> 13:35.981
One, two, three…

13:39.068 --> 13:40.319
four, five, six…

13:43.948 --> 13:45.157
seven, eight…

13:47.868 --> 13:49.578
nine, ten, eleven…

13:51.789 --> 13:53.999
[growling]

13:56.252 --> 13:57.545
Run.

13:58.879 --> 13:59.713
[Dae-su groans]

13:59.797 --> 14:01.298
[Mi-jin] Hey, follow me.

14:01.382 --> 14:02.299
[Dae-su groans in pain]

14:04.677 --> 14:07.930
[growling]

14:11.141 --> 14:13.143
[suspenseful music playing]

14:14.895 --> 14:18.315
[groaning]

14:25.072 --> 14:26.073
-Aah!
-[clanks]

14:26.156 --> 14:27.408
[all groan]

14:31.745 --> 14:34.290
-Are you okay?
-Take Dae-su and go.

14:34.373 --> 14:35.374
[Dae-su] Forget it.

14:37.501 --> 14:38.878
What are you doing?

14:38.961 --> 14:40.254
I said forget it.

14:45.509 --> 14:46.427
On-jo.

14:50.097 --> 14:51.140
[Mi-jin] Fuck.

14:51.724 --> 14:53.726
I feel this may be the end.

14:55.644 --> 14:56.687
Stay behind me.

14:58.606 --> 14:59.815
Don't be like this. Stay back.

15:03.527 --> 15:05.529
[thrilling music playing]

15:13.704 --> 15:15.706
[growling]

15:22.713 --> 15:25.591
[grunting]

16:00.292 --> 16:01.627
[screeches]

16:18.769 --> 16:20.980
[yelling]

16:24.149 --> 16:25.818
-[snarls]
-[whimpers]

16:34.660 --> 16:36.120
[snarls]

16:38.497 --> 16:39.373
[grunts]

16:46.839 --> 16:48.090
[swooshes]

16:56.682 --> 16:57.516
[grunts]

17:09.820 --> 17:10.988
[Wu-jin] Ha-ri!

17:13.240 --> 17:15.242
[Wu-jin screaming]

17:16.577 --> 17:17.786
Get off me!

17:23.459 --> 17:24.585
Fuck!

17:25.461 --> 17:26.920
[Ha-ri] Get off me!

17:27.004 --> 17:28.338
Get off of him!

17:28.422 --> 17:30.549
Get off! Hey!

17:30.632 --> 17:32.843
[grunting]

17:32.926 --> 17:34.303
[sobbing]

17:42.478 --> 17:43.312
[Mi-jin yells]

17:43.395 --> 17:44.229
Wu-jin.

17:44.730 --> 17:47.191
[Dae-su] Damn it. Oh, no.
[sobbing]

17:47.274 --> 17:49.818
Fuck! I knew this would happen.

17:50.527 --> 17:52.488
It's okay. It's okay.

17:54.031 --> 17:55.324
I knew it.

17:55.866 --> 17:58.994
-[Ha-ri] Wu-jin, look at me.
-[Wu-jin] Ha-ri.

17:59.912 --> 18:01.955
You really made it to the nationals?

18:02.539 --> 18:04.041
Mm-hm, I… I did.

18:04.124 --> 18:05.584
Liar.

18:05.667 --> 18:08.253
You came to school,
because you failed the preliminaries.

18:09.004 --> 18:11.423
Or else, you'd be at the tournament.

18:12.424 --> 18:13.717
If you lost,

18:13.801 --> 18:16.512
you should've gone home,
why did you come to the damn school?

18:17.429 --> 18:19.515
-I'm sorry.
-Hey.

18:21.058 --> 18:23.393
Keep doing archery. Okay?

18:24.353 --> 18:25.437
Mm-hm.

18:25.521 --> 18:26.688
Don't give up.

18:28.315 --> 18:32.069
-Okay?
-Yeah. Yeah.

18:32.152 --> 18:33.695
[groaning]

18:33.779 --> 18:36.824
Wu-jin, I'm sorry.

18:37.699 --> 18:40.577
No. No. Not Wu-jin, please.

18:41.495 --> 18:42.913
[Ha-ri] Don't do it.

18:42.996 --> 18:44.748
[sobs]
Fuck.

18:45.749 --> 18:48.961
-[sobbing]
-[bone crunches]

18:52.840 --> 18:54.842
[thrilling music playing]

19:04.935 --> 19:06.395
[snarls]

19:06.478 --> 19:07.729
I'm sorry.

19:07.813 --> 19:09.606
[growling]

19:13.610 --> 19:14.653
[groans]

19:15.404 --> 19:17.281
[gasping]

19:26.623 --> 19:27.499
Su-hyeok.

19:28.750 --> 19:29.751
Wu-jin…

19:30.377 --> 19:32.588
Wu-jin… Wu-jin…

19:32.671 --> 19:35.632
[crying]

19:41.513 --> 19:44.975
More are coming. Let's go.
There won't be any that way.

19:47.519 --> 19:49.188
Come on. Let's go.

19:56.445 --> 19:58.530
[Dae-su crying]

19:58.614 --> 20:00.908
Please don't. Come on.

20:00.991 --> 20:02.034
Let go.

20:06.330 --> 20:08.540
[clattering]

20:08.624 --> 20:09.625
[Ha-ri grunts]

20:12.753 --> 20:14.546
Don't die for no reason.

20:17.090 --> 20:22.095
[sobbing]

20:27.392 --> 20:29.686
[breathing shakily]

20:29.770 --> 20:30.771
[gulps]

20:32.064 --> 20:34.399
[breathing heavily]

20:35.192 --> 20:36.235
[gasps]

20:37.444 --> 20:39.154
If we run now, we're going to make it.

20:39.947 --> 20:41.823
We should have enough time.

20:43.367 --> 20:46.328
I know I've killed
a lot of zombies myself,

20:46.411 --> 20:49.623
but a human being would apologize
for killing her brother

20:49.706 --> 20:51.166
right in front of her.

21:00.384 --> 21:01.385
[gasps]

21:21.238 --> 21:23.865
[panting, coughing]

21:27.661 --> 21:28.578
[Nam-ra] Eat them.

21:30.747 --> 21:32.958
Eat them. Eat them all.

21:38.255 --> 21:40.549
Why not? You're hungry.

21:44.219 --> 21:45.595
Kill them.

21:45.679 --> 21:48.515
[panting]

21:52.853 --> 21:54.229
I'm hungry.

21:57.024 --> 22:00.193
[breathing sharply]

22:02.112 --> 22:06.325
[sobbing]

22:14.041 --> 22:16.668
[squelching]

22:19.755 --> 22:20.964
[exhales heavily]

22:24.343 --> 22:25.510
[sobs]

22:46.073 --> 22:46.907
Wait a sec.

22:46.990 --> 22:48.158
What?

22:49.034 --> 22:50.327
Nam-ra's gone.

22:51.828 --> 22:53.455
I'll be right back.

22:53.538 --> 22:55.165
-Su-hyeok!
-Hey, Su-hyeok.

22:56.541 --> 22:58.835
-You okay on your own?
-What are you going to do?

22:58.919 --> 23:01.004
-Go ahead. I'll catch up.
-On-jo.

23:01.088 --> 23:02.172
[Dae-su] Hey, On-jo!

23:02.255 --> 23:04.466
[Dae-su groaning]

23:14.810 --> 23:17.729
[panting]

23:35.789 --> 23:37.791
[flesh squishing]

23:39.543 --> 23:40.502
Hey, Nam-ra.

23:52.055 --> 23:53.557
Why are you all by yourself?

23:55.058 --> 23:56.226
Let's go.

23:58.311 --> 23:59.479
[Nam-ra] Stay back.

24:00.230 --> 24:01.273
Come on. Come with us.

24:02.524 --> 24:04.860
-Mm?
-I said stay back!

24:18.665 --> 24:19.624
Nam-ra!

24:19.708 --> 24:20.834
[grunts]

24:21.918 --> 24:24.671
Nam-ra. It's me, On-jo.

24:24.754 --> 24:26.006
Nam-ra, don't do this.

24:26.631 --> 24:27.716
Nam-ra!

24:33.680 --> 24:35.724
-Nam-ra.
-[grunting]

24:47.485 --> 24:50.780
[yelling]

24:52.657 --> 24:55.493
[sobbing]

24:56.661 --> 24:58.622
You can bite me. It's okay.

25:00.624 --> 25:02.167
It's okay. Trust me.

25:03.210 --> 25:04.669
It's okay, Nam-ra.

25:04.753 --> 25:08.590
[crying]

25:15.847 --> 25:17.557
On-jo. On-jo.

25:18.391 --> 25:19.559
Hey. Are you okay?

25:20.143 --> 25:21.102
Are you okay?

25:23.980 --> 25:24.814
[Su-hyeok] Nam-ra.

25:26.983 --> 25:27.901
Nam-ra.

25:30.362 --> 25:31.363
Hey, Nam-ra!

25:37.994 --> 25:40.455
[sobbing]

25:47.545 --> 25:48.546
Nam-ra!

25:50.215 --> 25:51.424
[Su-hyeok] Nam-ra!

25:54.886 --> 25:56.221
Nam-ra!

25:58.390 --> 25:59.349
Nam-ra!

26:17.325 --> 26:18.285
Come on.

26:19.286 --> 26:20.161
[solder 2] Up ahead!

26:30.171 --> 26:31.214
Survivors confirmed.

26:41.182 --> 26:43.601
Save yourselves! Hurry!

26:46.688 --> 26:48.732
Go home! Make it home!

26:50.066 --> 26:51.443
[So-ju] Go!

26:52.068 --> 26:54.529
Run! Go!

26:56.031 --> 26:57.073
[Wu-jin] Ha-ri!

26:57.157 --> 27:00.493
[screaming]

27:02.620 --> 27:03.705
[Cheong-san] Hey!

27:05.248 --> 27:06.416
All of you!

27:07.709 --> 27:11.254
Come after me! Today, I am…

27:12.922 --> 27:15.342
the happiest guy in this school!

27:41.284 --> 27:42.369
[U-sin] On-jo.

27:43.995 --> 27:45.121
U-sin.

27:47.374 --> 27:49.584
Are you okay? You're not hurt?

27:52.545 --> 27:53.671
What about your dad?

27:54.839 --> 27:58.218
Did you see him?
So-ju said he was going to go find you.

28:10.021 --> 28:11.856
RESCUE TEAM 1 NAM SO-JU

28:17.695 --> 28:20.031
[On-jo] I already knew the sorrow

28:21.241 --> 28:22.742
of being a survivor.

28:24.828 --> 28:29.249
But I didn't know
just how heavy that sorrow…

28:31.376 --> 28:33.002
would be.

28:34.504 --> 28:36.840
[investigator] Do you know
the teacher, Lee Byeong-chan?

28:38.133 --> 28:40.635
I only took morning classes,
because I had training.

28:41.594 --> 28:42.971
So no, I don't.

28:43.054 --> 28:46.766
Did he ever say, or do anything
out of the ordinary in the past?

28:48.268 --> 28:50.520
That's not important at all right now.

28:50.603 --> 28:53.398
Listen, I'm a senior.
I wanna go to college.

28:55.066 --> 28:57.068
If there's anything you wanna say,
just say it.

29:01.531 --> 29:04.826
What… How many times
do I have to tell you?

29:06.411 --> 29:10.498
He kidnapped a kid
from our class named Hyeon-ju.

29:10.582 --> 29:13.334
I heard he gave Hyeon-ju
some sort of injection.

29:13.418 --> 29:14.544
Why…

29:16.171 --> 29:17.297
Why did you leave us there?

29:21.843 --> 29:23.178
You abandoned us.

29:23.261 --> 29:25.680
-If you cooperate with our investigation--
-[On-jo] No.

29:25.764 --> 29:27.682
I won't ask adults for anything…

29:29.517 --> 29:31.019
ever again in my life.

29:34.063 --> 29:35.064
So, please…

29:37.150 --> 29:39.360
don't ask for my cooperation.

29:43.072 --> 29:46.034
[announcer 1] This notice goes out
to all citizens of Hyosan.

29:46.117 --> 29:49.871
[indistinct PA announcement]

29:49.954 --> 29:51.498
HOW MUCH TIME MUST PASS
FOR THIS TO END?

29:51.581 --> 29:53.333
I MISS YOU, PLEASE JUST SHOW UP

29:53.416 --> 29:54.584
I MISS YOU

29:54.667 --> 29:56.544
I MISS YOU, PARK JU-YEONG

30:01.674 --> 30:03.593
I LOVE YOU, U-GI

30:06.221 --> 30:09.432
FLOWING WATER ENVELOPS ME
AND FLOWS INTO MY PAINFUL MEMORIES

30:09.516 --> 30:10.767
I'LL LET YOU GO NOW

30:24.989 --> 30:27.534
[reporter 1] The National Assembly hearing
on the bombing of Hyosan

30:27.617 --> 30:30.119
has been postponed
upon agreement between the parties.

30:30.203 --> 30:33.206
The party leaders announced
in a joint statement today

30:33.289 --> 30:36.584
that they will not hold the hearing
until the Hyosan epidemic situation…

30:36.668 --> 30:39.712
Hyosan epidemic situation
has been completely resolved.

30:39.796 --> 30:41.172
The National Security Council

30:41.256 --> 30:44.342
announced that they will end martial law
on Hyosan today.

30:44.425 --> 30:47.804
[reporter 2] This comes three months
and 17 days since martial law

30:47.887 --> 30:50.390
was imposed due to the pandemic.

30:50.473 --> 30:54.561
However, as a precaution, Hyosan residents
will continue to be quarantined.

30:54.644 --> 30:58.481
Although it has been more than four months
since the Hyosan outbreak started,

30:58.565 --> 31:00.817
the Korea Disease Control
and Prevention Agency

31:00.900 --> 31:02.861
has failed to identify the virus.

31:02.944 --> 31:05.905
Since it is impossible
to know its incubation period,

31:05.989 --> 31:09.409
the Agency opposed ending
the quarantining of Hyosan residents.

31:09.492 --> 31:11.870
Donations are pouring in
from across the nation

31:11.953 --> 31:15.957
for the Hyosan residents who have been
living in quarantine for four months.

31:17.667 --> 31:19.669
[dramatic music playing]

31:26.551 --> 31:28.720
[indistinct chatter]

31:34.934 --> 31:38.646
[announcer 2] This notice is to remind you
of the curfew times.

31:39.606 --> 31:45.028
Curfew lasts from midnight
to 6 a.m. the next morning.

31:46.779 --> 31:50.241
During this time,
please remain in your shelters

31:50.325 --> 31:54.454
and refrain from moving around…

31:56.915 --> 31:58.708
This time will be used

31:58.791 --> 32:04.213
to inspect facilities,
and to clean and disinfect the camp.

32:05.965 --> 32:09.427
These measures are meant
to protect you from infection

32:10.428 --> 32:14.557
and to ensure that public facilities
remain clean for everyone to use.

32:44.379 --> 32:46.005
I-SAK, I MISS YOU

32:46.089 --> 32:49.425
NAM-RA, COME BACK

32:49.509 --> 32:53.429
CHEONG-SAN, I LOVE YOU

33:22.583 --> 33:25.670
LEE CHEONG-SAN

33:26.421 --> 33:27.380
I miss you, Cheong-san.

34:01.414 --> 34:02.915
ZOMBIE VICTIM SPECIAL ADMISSION

34:02.999 --> 34:05.251
HIGH SCHOOL SENIORS WHO SUFFERED
THE ZOMBIE ATTACK

34:05.334 --> 34:07.420
MUST BE GIVEN SPECIAL ADMISSIONS
INTO COLLEGES

34:08.796 --> 34:12.467
Goodness. My daughter is a senior, too.
You poor thing.

34:12.550 --> 34:13.885
Scissors!

34:13.968 --> 34:15.094
Oh, damn it.

34:18.181 --> 34:20.183
[kids laughing]

34:24.312 --> 34:26.939
KOREAN RED CROSS
HUMANITARIAN RELIEF GOODS

34:51.964 --> 34:53.299
Su-hyeok.

35:01.849 --> 35:03.101
Where have you been?

35:03.851 --> 35:04.936
I couldn't find you.

35:05.978 --> 35:07.772
I saw the others a few times around here.

35:09.607 --> 35:11.234
I wanted to see them,

35:12.944 --> 35:14.278
but I couldn't do it.

35:15.321 --> 35:17.198
I thought it might remind me.

35:17.824 --> 35:19.534
Will you forget if you don't see them?

35:21.160 --> 35:23.538
I went to the mountain last night
and saw a campfire.

35:25.331 --> 35:27.542
I think someone lit a fire
on the school rooftop.

35:30.670 --> 35:31.504
On the rooftop?

35:31.587 --> 35:33.089
Are you sure about that?

35:34.465 --> 35:37.718
I could have been mistaken,
but I'm pretty sure.

35:39.554 --> 35:42.890
Nam-ra said that we should have a campfire

35:44.100 --> 35:46.018
if we should ever meet again.

35:57.572 --> 35:58.823
I plan on going tonight.

35:59.448 --> 36:00.366
I'll go with you.

36:06.789 --> 36:07.957
I'm sorry about that day.

36:10.376 --> 36:11.210
What day?

36:11.919 --> 36:14.714
That day when Nam-ra tried to bite you.

36:15.715 --> 36:17.091
Sorry I couldn't do anything.

36:17.675 --> 36:19.010
Don't worry. It's okay.

36:21.596 --> 36:23.306
Your choice that day saved us all.

36:25.516 --> 36:26.642
Don't tell the others.

36:27.268 --> 36:29.478
It might be too dangerous,
so let's go by ourselves.

37:02.803 --> 37:04.764
I told you not to tell them.

37:09.852 --> 37:12.146
Hey, I told you not to tell anyone else.

37:15.858 --> 37:16.943
Um…

37:17.026 --> 37:18.694
I said it was between us.

37:20.947 --> 37:23.282
She said she'd tell the cops
if we didn't take her.

37:24.533 --> 37:27.620
They won't give me special admission
for surviving the zombie attack.

37:27.703 --> 37:31.374
How is that even related?
We'll be arrested if we get caught.

37:31.457 --> 37:33.834
Might as well go to jail
if I can't get into college.

37:34.961 --> 37:37.755
Let's go. Climb that wall, huh?

37:37.838 --> 37:40.132
Wait. You're really coming?

37:40.216 --> 37:41.425
All of you?

37:42.677 --> 37:44.637
You're not the only one who feels guilty.

37:44.720 --> 37:46.180
We were all hurt, too.

37:46.264 --> 37:48.307
Being alone doesn't make it hurt less.

37:53.646 --> 37:54.605
Come on.

37:54.689 --> 37:57.149
Didn't you say there was a rope?

37:57.233 --> 37:58.734
-How do we get up there?
-Move.

38:00.152 --> 38:01.028
Are you sure?

38:01.112 --> 38:03.281
I'm going as well.

38:03.364 --> 38:04.949
-[Ha-ri] Get on all fours.
-[Dae-su] What?

38:05.032 --> 38:06.450
-Come on.
-[Mi-jin] You heard her.

38:06.534 --> 38:08.536
[tense music playing]

38:24.427 --> 38:26.387
I MISS YOU ALL

38:37.106 --> 38:38.065
What's that?

38:39.108 --> 38:40.026
[Dae-su] Well…

38:40.818 --> 38:42.069
I couldn't throw it away.

38:44.697 --> 38:45.823
Joon-yeong.

38:47.033 --> 38:48.993
I promise to bring a box next time.

38:49.994 --> 38:50.828
[sighs]

38:56.042 --> 38:57.043
I see a light.

39:00.046 --> 39:01.839
-Do you?
-No. Where?

39:02.506 --> 39:03.382
It's over there.

39:04.008 --> 39:06.719
[Hyo-ryeong] Hey, I think
that really is our school.

39:12.683 --> 39:13.601
[Dae-su sighs]

39:14.810 --> 39:16.062
[Dae-su] What a mess.

39:18.731 --> 39:19.648
I know.

39:19.732 --> 39:22.360
[Dae-su breathes deeply]

39:44.090 --> 39:45.049
Come on.

39:52.139 --> 39:53.015
Mm-hm.

40:03.150 --> 40:10.157
THIS IS A SAFE ZONE
HYOSAN HIGH SCHOOL

40:45.151 --> 40:46.569
[Su-hyeok sighs]

40:49.155 --> 40:50.656
Do you really think it's Nam-ra?

40:52.741 --> 40:53.617
Mm-hm.

40:54.994 --> 40:56.495
I don't know why, but…

40:57.997 --> 40:59.081
I think it's her.

41:52.968 --> 41:54.303
Who do you think?

41:59.099 --> 41:59.975
Maybe…

42:00.851 --> 42:03.270
it was kids who came back
to the school like us.

42:05.648 --> 42:09.693
Maybe it was a YouTuber or something.

42:09.777 --> 42:11.487
Like those kids who like haunted houses.

42:16.742 --> 42:17.743
No.

42:20.120 --> 42:21.121
Nam-ra.

42:22.915 --> 42:25.251
Maybe she lit it because she missed us.

42:25.834 --> 42:27.002
How would you know that?

42:30.631 --> 42:31.924
I don't know for sure.

42:32.550 --> 42:34.093
But I think I do.

42:37.888 --> 42:38.889
[Nam-ra] You made it.

42:40.849 --> 42:41.767
Oh…

42:42.643 --> 42:43.644
The prez.

42:45.354 --> 42:46.564
Nam-ra.

43:07.126 --> 43:08.002
Hey, prez.

43:10.004 --> 43:11.630
Am I still your class president?

43:17.303 --> 43:18.262
It's nice.

43:20.681 --> 43:21.807
Are you okay?

43:23.267 --> 43:24.310
How have you been?

43:28.981 --> 43:30.983
[light music playing]

43:40.117 --> 43:41.410
I've missed you, guys.

43:44.997 --> 43:46.373
I've missed all of you.

43:49.335 --> 43:50.252
Nam-ra.

43:52.254 --> 43:54.673
I wanted to go see you,
but I didn't think I should.

43:54.757 --> 43:56.008
No, it's okay.

43:57.176 --> 43:59.511
Let's go. Come with us.

44:01.430 --> 44:03.140
I still have things that I have to do.

44:04.099 --> 44:05.392
What things?

44:06.560 --> 44:07.853
Mmm…

44:07.936 --> 44:09.730
There are some others like me.

44:10.481 --> 44:12.733
Some of them ran away
from the school a while ago,

44:12.816 --> 44:14.526
but there are still a few left.

44:15.944 --> 44:17.071
You're not a zombie.

44:18.822 --> 44:19.907
Don't say that.

44:20.532 --> 44:24.912
You know how we're not really kids,
but also not quite adults yet, either?

44:26.163 --> 44:27.164
[Nam-ra] That's like me.

44:28.040 --> 44:29.208
I'm neither a human…

44:31.627 --> 44:32.753
nor a monster.

44:33.462 --> 44:34.421
You're not.

44:36.882 --> 44:38.258
Please stay.

44:40.219 --> 44:41.679
It'll be okay.

44:55.567 --> 44:57.736
We're friends even if we're apart.

44:59.530 --> 45:00.406
Okay?

45:05.911 --> 45:06.745
Aren't we?

45:07.538 --> 45:09.373
[Su-hyeok] Yes, you're right.

45:09.456 --> 45:13.085
Wherever we are, we'll be friends.

45:14.837 --> 45:16.046
Well, that's good enough.

45:21.677 --> 45:22.511
It's them.

45:27.850 --> 45:28.851
[chuckles]

45:28.934 --> 45:29.935
See you, okay?

45:38.193 --> 45:40.195
[ominous music playing]

46:40.672 --> 46:42.674
[thrilling music playing]

51:00.056 --> 51:02.350
ALL CHARACTERS,
LOCATIONS, ORGANIZATIONS,

51:02.434 --> 51:04.144
AND EVENTS IN THIS SHOW ARE FICTIONAL.
